 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>Distributions </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT
STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We declared our first distribution on January&nbsp;29, 2009. Subject to the board of directors&#146; discretion and applicable legal restrictions, our board of directors intends to authorize and declare
