STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Revenues </I></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We generated investment income of $17,924 and $3,134 for the
