realized. See &#147;&#151;Critical Accounting Policies&#151;Capital Gains Incentive Fee.&#148; </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We recorded interest expense
