<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We determine the net asset value of our investment portfolio each quarter. Securities that are publicly-traded are valued at the reported
