Ltd., the real estate investment arm of the Government of Singapore Investment Corporation, in which Campus Apartments uses the venture&#146;s capital to acquire, develop, operate and manage student housing projects across the United States. In
addition to his duties as president and chief executive officer of Campus Apartments, Mr.&nbsp;Adelman is the </FONT></P>
