STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Gregory P. Chandler </I>has been Chief Financial Officer of Emtec, Inc. and President of Emtec Global Services Division since May 2009. Previously, he served as Managing Director, Investment Banking,
