 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px" ALIGN="center"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="toc188257_22"></A>DISTRIBUTION REINVESTMENT PLAN </B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We intend to declare ordinary cash distributions on either a semi-monthly or monthly basis and pay such distributions on either a monthly
