<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Beginning on February&nbsp;26, 2009, Franklin Square Holdings agreed to reimburse the Company for expenses in an amount that is
