<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The effective interest rate under the credit facility was 2.42% on March&nbsp;31, 2011. Interest is paid quarterly in arrears, and
