Organization </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">FS Investment Corporation, or the Company, was incorporated under the general corporation laws of the State
of Maryland on December&nbsp;21, 2007 and formally commenced operations on January&nbsp;2, 2009. The Company has elected to be regulated as a business development company, or BDC, under the Investment Company Act of 1940, as amended, or the 1940
