<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Capital Gains Incentive Fee: </I>Pursuant to the terms of the investment advisory and administrative services agreement the Company
