<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Our charter contains a provision which limits directors&#146; and officers&#146; liability, although not to the maximum extent permitted
